  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operation of Semi-Independent Living Units for Unaccompanied Migrant Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the proposed project is to contribute and expand the provision of rights-based protection, comprehensive and inclusive support to unaccompanied and separated children (UASCs) in Cyprus through a holistic approach. By end of 2026 the project will have facilitated the transition of 1690 beneficiaries out of current living spaces into a more sustainable, community embedded model of care - semi-independent living units while focusing on their life skills, access to health, psychological support, education, and extra-curricular activities.</narrative>
  </description>
